# Environment Variables (Optional)
# This project doesn't require environment variables by default
# Add any future environment variables here

# Example: Analytics
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Example: Contact Form API
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.example.com/contact

# Note: Variables prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_ are exposed to the browser
# Keep sensitive keys without the prefix (server-side only)
